    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of satire. It offers a <strong>dark-humored take on the phenomenon of tosatsu (\u76d7\u64ae) in Japan: The illegal act of taking secret upskirt photos.</strong> This game does not endorse or promote this behavior in real life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play in a 3D sandbox RPG set in the outskirts of Tokyo, where you're armed with a camera, poor judgment, and questionable morals. Take secret photos to earn cash and upgrade your gear. Panty shots are not enough?\u00a0\u00a0Interact with the locals and unlock all their secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam around in an outskirt of Tokyo taking secret upskirt pictures for profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your camera with fancy lenses to zoom in on your terrible decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the locals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date the locals! (They should probably know better.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the police! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make awful, life-defining choices. (Just like in real life!)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER THINGS TO DO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take <i>adorable</i> pussy photos. (Fluffy cats. Duh.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret spots to photograph more <i>things</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk for miles. (Don't say I didn't warn you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect deeply on the downsides of modern Japanese society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it worse.</p></li></ul>",
